{"id":67673,"title":"123 | Prometheus 基本概念","content":"普罗米修斯核心涵盖四种指标类型、两种采集模式及查询告警体系。指标类型包括：只增不减的计数器（Counter），适用于请求总数；可增可减的测量仪（Gauge），用于磁盘使用率等瞬时值；基于分桶统计分布的直方图（Histogram）；以及在客户端计算百分位的汇总（Summary）。数据采集支持直接采集与间接采集：应用内嵌代码或原生支持组件可直接暴露端点供抓取；黑盒系统则需借助 Exporter（如 Node Exporter、Redis Exporter）转换数据，特殊场景可用 Blackbox Exporter 探测端口健康。普罗米修斯默认 15 秒抓取一次，单机可支撑百万级指标。数据存储后通过 PromQL 引擎进行查询与聚合，该语言支持灵活表达式以实现复杂计算（如错误率分组统计）。告警机制由服务端每分钟评估规则触发，支持线性预测等函数预判故障；触发的告警交由 Alertmanager 处理，负责去重、分组及路由至邮件、即时通讯等不同通知渠道。掌握这些基础概念是构建高效监控体系的前提。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":44442,"user_name":"何永鹏","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1019925,"ip_address":"","ucode":"3BF6CD283D1269","user_header":"/0","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1543450046,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":15964,"content":"功能有类似，但datadog是商用产品，prometheus是开源","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1543492730,"ip_address":"","comment_id":44442,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"和 datadog 功能差不多","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":430762,"discussion_content":"功能有类似，但datadog是商用产品，prometheus是开源","content_length":33,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1543492730,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":101414,"user_name":"又双叒叕是一年啊","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1000015,"ip_address":"","ucode":"E067320E537DEE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/acco